<title>PHILIPPINES: PHILIPPINE 24-HOUR WEATHER FORECAST - AUG 11.</title>
<headline>PHILIPPINE 24-HOUR WEATHER FORECAST - AUG 11.</headline>
<text>
<p>++++</p>
<p>STORM ALERT -- -  ALL CLEAR</p>
<p>METRO MANILA --  Partly cloudy with afternoon or evening</p>
<p>			isolated rainshowers or thunderstorm. Winds</p>
<p>			light southwesterly. Temp. 25-33</p>
<p>BAGUIO CITY  --  Partly cloudy with isolated rainshowers or</p>
<p>			thunderstorms. Winds light to moderate</p>
<p>			southwesterly. 15-22</p>
<p> METRO CEBU   --  Partly cloudy to cloudy with rainshowers</p>
<p>			and thunderstorms. Winds light southwesterly.</p>
<p>			25-32.</p>
<p>METRO DAVAO  --  Partly cloudy to cloudy with isolated</p>
<p>			rainshowers  and thunderstorms. Winds light</p>
<p>			southwesterly. 24-32.</p>
</text>
